<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Burns Philp says m.d. Clack to retire.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Burns Philp says m.d. Clack to retire.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food ingredients company Burns Philp and Co Ltd said on Monday that managing director Ian Clack planned to retire.</p>
<p>The company also said it suffered a third quarter loss of A$24.4 million and expected that its 1996/97 fourth quarter to end-June would be below the year-ago level but better than the third quarter.</p>
</text>
